Package: GiottoAtlas
Title: Static Spatial Biology Viewer for GiottoDisk Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("George", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "balrith@gmail.com")
Description: A static web viewer for GiottoDisk-backed spatial biology data using
    deck.gl and DuckDB WASM. Supports transcript scatter, polygon outlines, density
    rasterization, and gene filtering. Includes bidirectional R communication via
    httpuv WebSocket for annotation workflows.
License: MIT
Imports:
    arrow,
    dplyr,
    jsonlite,
    httpuv,
    later,
    R6
Suggests:
    GiottoClass,
    GiottoDisk
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
